      <title>DeepSeek-R1：用强化学习激发大模型推理能力</title>
      <link>/p/deepseek-r1%E7%94%A8%E5%BC%BA%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E4%B9%A0%E6%BF%80%E5%8F%91%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E6%8E%A8%E7%90%86%E8%83%BD%E5%8A%9B/</link>
